{"title":"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/998a441f021d359a251d8b1e7df1a46d19fa36bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/d/30d636df6efb15e1d96e2173d59ac290941c230d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{1}{8} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{1}{6} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{2}{6} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"404\" height=\"38\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc342fea9632bd485063efa2752a06077e53cf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{1 \\times 2}{2 \\times 2} + \\frac{1 \\times 1}{4 \\times 1} = \\frac{2}{4} + \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"258\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e4cfe9ebbde53783ba19a652599363f4b51ae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2 + 1}{4} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } \\frac{3}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"148\" height=\"49\" />\n